  "releaseNotes": [
    "authority (SV-D10): schema source moves to biotech-knowledge-services schema/source/biotech-schema-v2.1.0, initialized byte-for-byte from the verified pinned v2.0.2 inputs (the copied inputs regenerate v2.0.2's contentTreeDigest exactly); the absent biotech-meta checkout is historical provenance only",
    "kernel Activity: verificationRunRef, runManifestDigest, runSealKind (RunSealKind VERIFICATION_SNAPSHOT | DECISION_SNAPSHOT | ADMISSION_SNAPSHOT), useDecisionRef, boundEffectDigest, effectKey, originatingOrigin, revocationEpoch (all nullable)",
    "kernel Report: reportRevisionRef, reportSchema, reportKindRef, structuredBodyDigest, supersedesReportRevisionRef, custodyKind (all nullable; existing bodyDigest, bodyUri, ledgerDigest, reportKind and supersedesUid unchanged; Report has no time-coverage model, none added)",
    "kernel Assessment: rubricRef, policyRef, useDecisionRef, useDisposition (UseDisposition ADMITTED | HELD | REJECTED), revocationEpoch, expiresAt, reviewerAdjudicationRef (all nullable; the existing disposition stays the claim-vetting disposition)",
    "kernel Assertion: assertionVersionRef, logicalAssertionId, supportSetDigest, qualifiersDigest (all nullable; profile qualifiers are hashed, not modeled)",
    "registers/node-register.yaml: otherProperties counts and notes for the four kernel types; no new filter property, relationship or index",
    "workspace-inputs/task-routes.yaml: state.attach removed from ingest-product-label, ingest-study-publication and correct-a-stale-fact (not a biotech-knowledge-intent.v2 kind); the label-version step uses edge.assert",
    "query-catalog/explain.json: EXPLAIN evidence inherited unchanged from biotech-schema-v2.0.2 (Neo4j 5.26 community run of that release); no query source changed, so every template statement digest still matches; no new live-database EXPLAIN was run for v2.1.0"
  ],
